Build StoryFrame, a multi-workflow AI video studio.

Treat this as a fresh product specification.
If code exists, inspect it and preserve working features.
Do not assume any previous phase is complete.

PRODUCT MODES
A. Educational explainers and fictional stories.
B. Product ads for small businesses.
C. Repurposing uploaded footage into short clips.

INITIAL SCOPE
- 30–90-second vertical videos for Mode A.
- Short product ads for Mode B.
- Reviewed excerpts from uploaded recordings for Mode C.
- Editable scripts, scenes, media, narration, text, and timing.
- Real downloadable video output.

SELECTED SERVICES
- Ollama Cloud: all language-model tasks.
- Supabase: authentication and application database.
- Cloudflare R2: private media and rendered outputs.
- Cloudflare Workers AI: budget image generation.
- Leonardo AI: optional image generation.
- Deepgram: text-to-speech.
- Deepgram transcription: verify separately for Mode C.
- JSON2Video: composition and rendering.
- Pexels/Pixabay: normalized stock search.

Do not silently replace these services.

